{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/marriott-mag-group-barsha-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":583,"crm_id":"111","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Marriott","slug":"marriott-mag-group-barsha-south","display_address":"Barsha South","building_type":["apartment","townhouse","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"MAG Group","price":2038792,"display_price":"2.03M","lattitude":25.079888,"longitude":55.245899,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Marriott Executive Apartments is a premium luxury development by Mag Group, located in one of Dubai's key neighborhoods, Al Barsha.</p><p>The complex provides residents with a variety of world-class services, amenities and entertainment: swimming pool with recreational facilities, gym with fitness zone, barbecue areas, children's club and playground, covered parking, security and concierge.</p><p>In the immediate vicinity are significant places of Dubai: Burj Al Arab and Mall of the Emirates. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are 15 minutes away, while Dubai Butterfly Garden and Dubai Miracle Garden can be reached in 12 minutes.</p><p>The design of the complex is contemporary in style. Public and living areas are made of natural wood, marble and other premium materials. All apartments, penthouses and townhouses have thoughtfully designed layouts and panoramic windows offering breathtaking views of Dubai Marina, Burj al Arab, Dubai Hills and Burj Khalifa.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/111/images/2024/01/23/xeQkAzJjx6LX85z68iMSXLeT87ZrVbU4YNHHbrBn.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/01/23/xeQkAzJjx6LX85z68iMSXLeT87ZrVbU4YNHHbrBn.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.